<title>GERMANY: German Jan wholesale sales sector breakdown.</title>
<headline>German Jan wholesale sales sector breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office released the following detailed breakdown of wholesale turnover by sector. Figures are unadjusted.  </p>
<p>GERMAN WHOLESALE SALES	JANUARY 1997 VS JANUARY 1996</p>
<p>					  NOMINAL	    REAL  Total</p>
<p>					   +4.0		+3.0  </p>
<p>Raw materials</p>
<p>semifinished  goods and scrap    +3.0	     UNCHANGED  </p>
<p>Food, beverages, tobacco	   +7.0		+5.0</p>
<p>Consumer and durable goods	 -1.0		-1.0</p>
<p>Machinery, equipment and</p>
<p>accessories			    +6.0	     +11.0  </p>
<p>Other wholesale			+4.0		+4.0  </p>
<p>Agricultural basic materials  </p>
<p>and livestock,			 +5.0		+3.0  </p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, +49 228 26097</p>
</text>
